### Get all restaurants projections
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/restaurants
Accept: application/json

### Get a restaurant with its details
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/restaurants/1b918dcd-d3f0-4e32-977f-da2b8855a15d
Accept: application/json

### Filter restaurants by cuisine and price
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/restaurants/filter?cuisine=Italian&priceRange=Regular
Accept: application/json

### Filter dishes with tags and type
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/dishes/03080bb4-f5c9-464e-bf00-217d045af233/filter?type=&tags=gluten
Accept: application/json

### Get vegan desserts sorted by name descending
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/dishes/03080bb4-f5c9-464e-bf00-217d045af233/filter?type=entree&tags=&sortBy=name&direction=desc
Accept: application/json

### Add a dish to a basket
PATCH  http://localhost:8080/api/orders/basket/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "menuId": "16f78885-9eaa-4f36-9f90-3bcc5deff38b",
  "dishId": "61e3d481-8dfc-401a-9aa1-7b88aa99c716",
  "restaurantId": "4320b75b-5877-4145-803d-ddec8282336b",
  "quantity": 1
}

### Checkout Basket
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/basket/c210070a-76a0-47d0-8774-a6a12da374b2/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "street": "Main Street",
  "number": 123,
  "city": "Antwerp",
  "country": "Belgium"
}